                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{O}_X\to f_*\mathcal{O}_Y
            which is a surjection; but alternatively
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi 𝒪
                    %mi Y
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{O}_Y
            can be recovered from
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi X
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X
            and the defining sheaf of ideals
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
